  m_Name: M3_08_Shift_Debrief
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Valari.Data.TutorialData
  <Title>k__BackingField: Shift Simulation Debrief
  <Description>k__BackingField: Your shift simulation is complete. The AI has calculated
    your cumulative route efficiency across all 10 orders. You can see your total
    distance walked compared to the optimal total, the number of zone re-entries
    flagged, and the three orders where your efficiency was lowest. Study the order-by-order
    breakdown. Consistent inefficiency on certain order types, such as multi-zone
    orders or batched picks. This tells you exactly where to focus your improvement.
    The AI will also flag whether idle time or congestion response affected your
    score.
  <VoiceOver>k__BackingField: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 86b9f8a3984300d4c99695e6d98cf9f3, type: 3}
  <HasChallenges>k__BackingField: 1
  <IsInOrder>k__BackingField: 1
  TutorialChallengeLists:
  - <ChallengeTitle>k__BackingField: Review the Full Shift Debrief
    <ChallengeTriggerName>k__BackingField: TRIGGER_M3_ShiftDebriefConfirmed
